  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_3842.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>45 fotos de la tarde de este domingo, 3 de agosto,&nbsp;con toros y vacas, con el patrocinio de la pe&ntilde;a Choto Modorro, en las fiestas patronales de Toga,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_3934.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>de las que este lunes se han adue&ntilde;ado las mujeres tafarreras (69 fotos sobre ellas).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga14domingolunes/img_3790.jpg\" alt=\"img_3790\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga14domingolunes/img_3791.jpg\" alt=\"img_3791\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga14domingolunes/img_3792.jpg\" alt=\"img_3792\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga14domingolunes/img_3793.jpg\" alt=\"img_3793\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga14domingolunes/img_3794.jpg\" alt=\"img_3794\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga14domingolunes/img_3797.jpg\" alt=\"img_3797\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga14domingolunes/img_3798.jpg\" alt=\"img_3798\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga14domingolunes/img_3799.jpg\" alt=\"img_3799\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e